OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry start with a mix
OL,6,Fof cloud and some spells of sunshine.
OL,7,FA few showers may develop from the
OL,8,Fmiddle of the day, mainly across the
OL,9,Fnorth. Feeling cooler than of late,
OL,10,Fespecially in the strengthening
OL,11,Fwesterly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA breezy evening to come with
OL,14,Fsome further showers moving southwards
OL,15,Facross the region. The breeze and
OL,16,Fshowers will gradually ease overnight
OL,17,Fallowing some clearer spells to
OL,18,Fdevelop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
