OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA few showers around first
OL,6,Fthing on Thursday, but these will
OL,7,Fquickly fade leaving a largely dry day
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells. Lighter winds than
OL,9,Ftoday with temperatures around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLargely
OL,12,Fdry with sunny spells on Friday and
OL,13,FSaturday. In the sunshine it will be
OL,14,Ffeeling increasingly warmer, before a
OL,15,Frisk of some showery rain returns on
OL,16,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
